    "name": "Stellar Shapers",
    "steam_appid": 3429050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.poster.avif?t=1741393888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.webm?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.mp4?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Shapers</strong> is a space survival game, an <strong>action roguelike</strong> with RPG elements where you use your strategy to combine design, weapons and passive skills, shaping your ship to your style, facing increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the captain of the ship, it's your duty to make your crew survive the hostile environment and enemies who want your spoils. Manage the resources necessary for your ship, avoiding them from running out, such as ores, food and fuel, in addition to the constant danger of radiation and extreme temperatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Editing\u00a0Freedom </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ship by placing new parts wherever you want, paint them, rotate them, use your creativity to create your own design and new strategies each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.poster.avif?t=1741393888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.webm?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.mp4?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the design of your ship with modules, chips, researches, reshaping your strategy in real time with endless possibilities. Adjust the difficulty through modifiers, changing the enemies' attacks from cotton candy to lethal shots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frenetic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of increasingly stronger enemies, requiring new tactics to overcome them. Beware, as skilled and fearless captains are also after you, with powerful ships that'll make every second of the battle count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fight, you'll have time to breathe! Pickup collectibles through space, destroy asteroids to collect resources, find valuable treasures and power-ups that'll save your crew. Use the environment to turn the game to your advantage, but be careful of dangers that lurk in the vast darkness of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards with each match to strengthen your ship on your journey. Advance through the upgrade tree to define your own play style. Unlock new modules and chips or make them even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/62d8d62b9873f7b4e23305b66ab57b82.avif?t=1741393888\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From gamers to gamers, have fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.poster.avif?t=1741393888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.webm?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/ada358e863f9365ed0a91004523129aa.mp4?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Shapers</strong> is a space survival game, an <strong>action roguelike</strong> with RPG elements where you use your strategy to combine design, weapons and passive skills, shaping your ship to your style, facing increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the captain of the ship, it's your duty to make your crew survive the hostile environment and enemies who want your spoils. Manage the resources necessary for your ship, avoiding them from running out, such as ores, food and fuel, in addition to the constant danger of radiation and extreme temperatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Editing\u00a0Freedom </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ship by placing new parts wherever you want, paint them, rotate them, use your creativity to create your own design and new strategies each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.poster.avif?t=1741393888\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.webm?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/3cc0391edfc35745c1f7dac3bb57a314.mp4?t=1741393888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Possibilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the design of your ship with modules, chips, researches, reshaping your strategy in real time with endless possibilities. Adjust the difficulty through modifiers, changing the enemies' attacks from cotton candy to lethal shots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frenetic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of increasingly stronger enemies, requiring new tactics to overcome them. Beware, as skilled and fearless captains are also after you, with powerful ships that'll make every second of the battle count.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the fight, you'll have time to breathe! Pickup collectibles through space, destroy asteroids to collect resources, find valuable treasures and power-ups that'll save your crew. Use the environment to turn the game to your advantage, but be careful of dangers that lurk in the vast darkness of the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards with each match to strengthen your ship on your journey. Advance through the upgrade tree to define your own play style. Unlock new modules and chips or make them even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429050/extras/62d8d62b9873f7b4e23305b66ab57b82.avif?t=1741393888\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From gamers to gamers, have fun!</p>",
